Linus,

please pull yet another ALSA updates for 2.6.28 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

This contains mostly build error/warning fixes, in addition to one
unbalanced lock fix for the new us122l driver, and updates of Realtek
codec support.


Thanks!

Takashi

===

Arun KS (1):
      ALSA: ASoC: Fix compile-time warning for tlv320aic23.c

Kailang Yang (6):
